    },
    {
      "sentence": "Therefore, the comment is fully actionable with explicit and concrete guidance.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "This conclusion incorrectly applies the rubric threshold for score 5. The comment has an explicit action (clarify the point) but no concrete details on how to execute that action, which matches the criteria for score 3, not 5."
